abel=\"Open menu\" class=\"v3-menu-toggle\">MENU <span>☰</span></button></div></header><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"v4-red-symbol\" src=\"/assets/aroz-logo.png\"/><dialog aria-label=\"Main menu\" id=\"v3-menu\"><div class=\"v3-menu-top\"><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">START A PROJECT</a><button aria-label=\"Close menu\" class=\"v3-close\">MENU ×</button></div><nav><a href=\"/webdesign/index.html\">Web Design</a><a href=\"/seo/index.html\">SEO</a><a href=\"/ki-seo/index.html\">AI SEO</a><a href=\"/copywriting/index.html\">Copywriting</a><a href=\"/projekte/index.html\">Projects</a><a href=\"/agentur/index.html\">Agency</a><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">Contact</a></nav><a class=\"v3-about-pill\" href=\"/agentur/index.html\">✦ The story of AROZ</a><div class=\"v3-menu-contact\"><span>PROJECT ENQUIRIES</span><a href=\"/kontakt/index.html\">Let's talk ↗</a><p>Schwelm · NRW</p></div><div class=\"v3-menu-services\"><a href=\"/seo/index.html\">SEO</a><a href=\"/ki-seo/index.html\">AI SEO</a><a href=\"/copywriting/index.html\">Copywriting</a></div></dialog>\n<div aria-label=\"Breadcrumb navigation\" class=\"r6-breadcrumb r6-wrap\"><a href=\"../../index.html\">Homepage</a><span>/</span><a href=\"../index.html\">SEO</a><span>/</span><span aria-current=\"page\">Local SEO.</span></div>\n<main id=\"main\"><section aria-labelledby=\"r6-title\" class=\"r6-hero\"><div class=\"r6-hero-copy\"><p class=\"r6-kicker\">AR<span>O</span>Z <i aria-hidden=\"true\">/</i> SEO <i aria-hidden=\"true\">/</i> 01 / The real question</p><h1 id=\"r6-title\"><span class=\"r6-subject\">Local SEO.</span>Visible where it matters.</h1><p class=\"r6-lead\">Help people in the region find the right business.</p><div class=\"r6-hero-actions\"><a class=\"r6-button\" href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Discuss local visibility <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"r6-text-link\" href=\"#gedanke\">More about our approach <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div><div class=\"r6-meta\"><span>ANALYSIS / STRUCTURE / IMPACT</span><span>Schwelm / NRW</span></div></div><div class=\"r6-hero-art\"><span class=\"r6-art-index\">02 / LOCAL</span><div aria-label=\"Illustration of our approach\" class=\"concept-art concept-local\"><div class=\"concept-title\">Local context</div><div class=\"local-grid\"><div><small>BUSINESS</small><b>Who?</b></div><div><small>SERVICE</small><b>What?</b></div><div class=\"local-place\"><small>REGION</small><b>Where?</b><span>Schwelm · NRW</span></div></div><div class=\"concept-caption\">Context instead of generic location pages</div></div></div></section><section aria-label=\"Example project from the AROZ portfolio\" class=\"r6-case\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-case-grid\"><div class=\"r6-case-media\"><img alt=\"Existing AROZ project image: Fast Drive Wuppertal\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"../../assets/project-fastdrive-2.webp\"/></div><div class=\"r6-case-body\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">AROZ / IN PRACTICE</span><h2>Fast Drive Wuppertal.</h2><p>An insight into the agency's design work. This example presents the project; it is not an isolated performance metric for this individual service.</p><a href=\"../../projekte/fahrschule-fast-drive/index.html\">View project <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-thinking\" id=\"gedanke\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-thinking-grid\"><div class=\"r6-section-side\"><p class=\"r6-small-label\">01 / The real question</p><div class=\"r6-stamp\">SEO<span> / Strategy</span></div></div><div class=\"r6-thinking-main\"><h2 class=\"r6-oversized\">Which locations and needs should your website be relevant to?</h2><div class=\"r6-thinking-bottom\"><p>Local visibility comes from clear location information, relevant service pages and a credible digital presence. Simply listing place names does not help visitors. We connect the actual service area, services offered and user questions. Local pages are created only where they offer distinct value.</p><blockquote>Local connection is more than a postcode.</blockquote></div></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-focus r6-focus-seo\" id=\"schwerpunkte\"><div class=\"r6-wrap\"><header class=\"r6-focus-heading\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">02 / What we review</span><h2>Local relevance needs to be real.</h2><p>Locations, services and genuine regional questions belong together. We avoid place names without specific value.</p></header><ol class=\"r6-focus-list\"><li><span>01</span><strong>Consistent business information</strong></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Relevant regional content</strong></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Clear contact and location signals</strong></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"r6-how\" id=\"ablauf\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-how-grid\"><div class=\"r6-how-intro\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">03 / Priorities</span><h2>Show the location.<br/><em>Explain the relevance.</em></h2><p>Local discoverability comes from consistent business information and useful answers for real regions.</p></div><ol class=\"r6-steps\"><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">01</span><div><h3>Understand the region</h3><p>Which locations are actually in the service area, and which enquiries should come from them?</p></div></li><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">02</span><div><h3>Align signals</h3><p>Present contact details and service descriptions consistently and clearly.</p></div></li><li class=\"r6-step\"><span class=\"r6-step-no\">03</span><div><h3>Strengthen local pages</h3><p>Demonstrate real local relevance with useful information and clear internal linking.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"r6-result\" id=\"ergebnis\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-result-inner\"><div><span class=\"r6-small-label\">04 / Recognising quality</span><h2>Clear service and location signals.</h2></div><div><p>A local structure that helps visitors find the right service in their region.</p><div aria-label=\"Useful details for starting a project\" class=\"r7-brief\"><p class=\"r7-brief-label\">So we can give you a specific answer</p><ul><li>Locations and regions actually served</li><li>Services and existing business profiles</li></ul><p class=\"r7-brief-note\">No account access or passwords required.</p></div><a href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Review your locations <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-next\"><div class=\"r6-wrap\"><div class=\"r6-next-title\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">EXPLORE FURTHER / RELATED TOPICS</span><h2>Local signals work together.</h2></div><div class=\"r6-links\"><a href=\"../seo-fuer-websites/index.html\"><span>Website SEO.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"../../webdesign/website-erstellen-lassen/index.html\"><span>Website Creation.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"../../ki-seo/entitaeten-seo/index.html\"><span>Entity SEO.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"r6-end\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-end-inner\"><span class=\"r6-small-label\">AROZ / CONTACT</span><h2>Make your case<br/>where people <em>search.</em></h2><a class=\"r6-button\" href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Enquire about local SEO <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section></main>\n<footer class=\"r6-footer\"><div class=\"r6-wrap r6-footer-inner\"><div><img alt=\"AROZ\" height=\"52\" src=\"../../assets/aroz-logo.png\" width=\"112\"/><p>Strategy, web design, SEO and communication.<br/>From Schwelm, for businesses with ambition.</p></div><div class=\"r6-footer-actions\"><a href=\"../../kontakt/index.html\">Contact</a><a href=\"../../impressum/index.html\">Legal Notice (review draft)</a><a href=\"../../datenschutz/index.html\">Privacy Policy (review draft)</a></div></div></footer>\n\n\n","headScripts":[]}
